		"description": "<p><em>Mechanical Mayhem turret — learned at level 7, 11 or 15.</em></p><p><strong>Electro-Net Turret.</strong> Utility. Reach 6, Damage: 1d6 Lightning. On hit: target is Slowed, 1 turn. <strong>Toolbelt:</strong> Reach 6, Blast 2, Damage: INTd6. The area becomes Slowed Terrain for 2 rounds; creatures that start or end their turn there, or enter it, take INT Lightning damage (ignoring armor) and must make a STR save or be Restrained and Dazed for 1 turn.</p><hr><p><em>[A] Once picked, Turret Deployed! offers the Electro-Net Turret alongside the Rifle Turret.</em></p>",
